CHAPTER.VERS:
Take

          {+}
         the sum of all the congregation of the sons of Israel, by their families, by their fathers' houses, according to the number of the names, every male, by their polls;

And with you

          {+}
         there will be a man of each tribe; [each] man head of his fathers' house.

And these are the names of the men who will stand with you

          {+}
        . Of Reuben: Elizur the son of Shedeur.
